sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Portal
    participant Pega as Pega Engine
    participant CT as Case Type
    participant Flow as pyDefault Flow
    participant DB as Database

    User->>Pega: Create Case (Add Case)
    Pega->>CT: Instantiate Work- instance
    CT->>DB: Obj-Save (New case ID)
    DB-->>CT: Case created (pzInsKey)
    CT->>Flow: Start pyDefault flow
    Flow->>Pega: Create first Assignment
    Pega-->>User: Show Perform harness
